Independent junction temperatures under a shared bias
* Provenance: original circuit for Sansho release-prep verification.
.temp 55
Vbias b 0 0.6
Vd b d 0
D1 d 0 dd temp=25
Vd2 b warm 0
D2 warm 0 dd dtemp=15
Vca ca 0 1
Vcb cb 0 1
Q1 ca b 0 qq temp=25
Q2 cb b 0 qq dtemp=15
.model dd D(is=5e-15)
.model qq npn(is=1e-16 bf=80 xtb=1)
.op
.end
